{
    "$comment" : [
        "1.`ms-vscode.cpptools` 扩展的内联建议总是转圈圈，可改为 `llvm-vs-code-extensions.vscode-clangd` 扩展的内联建议。",
        "  启用 clang 的内联建议需要:",
        "    1. 启用 clang 内联配置;",
        "       * `...`",
        "    2. 指定 `compile_commands.json` 文件的位置;",
        "       * `${sourceDir}/.vscode/settings.json : {clangd.arguments:[--compile-commands-dir=out/build/base-windows-debug]}`",
        "    3. 生成 `compile_commands.json` 文件需要:",
        "       1. 指定 `cmake ... -DCMAKE_EXPORT_COMPILE_COMMANDS=ON` 编译参数;",
        "       2. 不能使用 Visual Studio 多配置生成器， `CMAKE_EXPORT_COMPILE_COMMANDS` 只对单配置生成器（例如 Ninja / Unix Makefiles）有效;",
        "          * `cmake ... -G Ninja`",
        "       3. `Ninja` 不支持  `architecture:x64` 参数;",
        "          * `${sourceDir}/CMakePresets.json : {configurePresets:[{architecture:x64}]}`",
        "    4. 需要手动添加编译环境:",
        "       1. 需要指定 `Windows SDK` 目录，否则自动找到的 SDK 版本可能不正确",
        "          * `...=C:/Windows Kits/10/{bin,Include,Lib}/10.0.26100.0/`",
        "          * `PATH=.../bin/.../x64`",
        "          * `INCLUDE=.../Include/.../ucrt;.../Include/.../um;.../Include/.../shared;.../Include/.../winrt`",
        "          * `LIB=.../lib/.../ucrt/x64;.../lib/.../um/x64`",
        "       2. 需要添加 `ucrtd.lib` 文件所在路径",
        "          * `...=C:/app/dev/msvs/2022/enterprise/VC/Tools/MSVC/14.44.35207`",
        "          * `PATH=.../bin/HostX64/x64`",
        "          * `INCLUDE=.../include`",
        "          * `LIB=.../lib/x64`",
        "       3. 指定编译器路径;",
        "          * `...=C:/app/dev/msvs/2022/enterprise/VC/Tools/MSVC/14.44.35207/bin/HostX64/x64`",
        "          * `cacheVariables:{CMAKE_C_COMPILER:.../cl.exe,CMAKE_CXX_COMPILER:.../cl.exe}`",
        "2.引用环境变量时 `$env{XXX}`/`$penv{XXX}` 中的 `env`/`penv` 均区分大小写且均需要全部小写，否则传递给 `cmake` 时仅会被认为是字符串而无法解析。",
        "3.cmake presets 配置使用数组表示多继承，多继承时从前向后应用，不同配置之间相同名称会被覆盖。",
        "4.查看preset列表：",
        "  configure    : cmake --list-presets",
        "  build&install: cmake --build --list-presets",
        "  test         : ctest --list-presets",
        "  pack         : cpack --list-presets"
    ],
    "version": 10,
    "configurePresets": [
        {
            "name": "base-configure",
            "displayName": "configure for all",
            "description": "configure for all",
            "hidden": true,
            "generator": "Ninja",
            "binaryDir": "${sourceDir}/out/build/$env{BUILD_TYPE}",
            "installDir": "${sourceDir}/out/install/$env{BUILD_TYPE}",
            "toolchainFile": "$env{VCPKG_ROOT}/scripts/buildsystems/vcpkg.cmake",
            "cacheVariables": {
                "CMAKE_INSTALL_PREFIX": "${sourceDir}/out/install/$env{BUILD_TYPE}",
                "CMAKE_TOOLCHAIN_FILE": "$env{VCPKG_ROOT}/scripts/buildsystems/vcpkg.cmake",
                "CMAKE_PREFIX_PATH": "$env{QT_ROOT}",
                "BUILD_TESTING": "ON",
                "CMAKE_EXPORT_COMPILE_COMMANDS": "ON",
                "CMAKE_BUILD_TYPE": "$env{BUILD_TYPE}"
            }
        },
        {
            "name": "base-windows-configure-define",
            "displayName": "configure define",
            "description": "configure define for windows",
            "condition":
            {
                "type": "equals",
                "lhs": "${hostSystemName}",
                "rhs": "Windows"
            },
            "hidden": true,
            "cmakeExecutable": "$env{CMAKE_ROOT}/bin/cmake.exe",
            "environment": {
                "QT_ENV_PATH"     : "$env{QT_ROOT}/bin;$penv{PATH}",
                "SDK_BIN_PATH"    : "$env{SDK_ROOT}/bin/$env{SDK_VERSION}/",
                "SDK_INCLUDE_PATH": "$env{SDK_ROOT}/Include/$env{SDK_VERSION}",
                "SDK_LIB_PATH"    : "$env{SDK_ROOT}/Lib/$env{SDK_VERSION}",
                "SDK_ENV_PATH"    : "$env{SDK_BIN_PATH}/$env{BUILD_ARCH}",
                "SDK_ENV_INCLUDE" : "$env{SDK_INCLUDE_PATH}/ucrt;$env{SDK_INCLUDE_PATH}/um;$env{SDK_INCLUDE_PATH}/shared;$env{SDK_INCLUDE_PATH}/winrt",
                "SDK_ENV_LIB"     : "$env{SDK_LIB_PATH}/ucrt/$env{BUILD_ARCH};$env{SDK_LIB_PATH}/um/$env{BUILD_ARCH}",
                "VC_ROOT"         : "$env{VCINSTALLDIR}/Tools/MSVC/14.44.35207",
                "VC_ENV_PATH"     : "$env{VC_ROOT}/bin/HostX64/$env{BUILD_ARCH}",
                "VC_ENV_INCLUDE"  : "$env{VC_ROOT}/include",
                "VC_ENV_LIB"      : "$env{VC_ROOT}/lib/$env{BUILD_ARCH}",
                "PATH"   : "$env{VC_ENV_PATH};$env{SDK_ENV_PATH};$env{QT_ENV_PATH};$env{NINJA_ROOT};$penv{PATH}",
                "INCLUDE": "$env{VC_ENV_INCLUDE};$env{SDK_ENV_INCLUDE};$penv{INCLUDE}",
                "LIB"    : "$env{VC_ENV_LIB};$env{SDK_ENV_LIB};$penv{LIB}"
            },
            "cacheVariables": {
                "CMAKE_CXX_COMPILER": "$env{VC_ENV_PATH}/cl.exe",
                "CMAKE_MAKE_PROGRAM": "$env{NINJA_ROOT}/ninja.exe"
            }
        },
        {
            "name": "base-windows-configure-example",
            "displayName": "configure path and debug",
            "description": "configure path and set debug model for windows x64",
            "condition": {
                "type": "equals",
                "lhs": "${hostSystemName}",
                "rhs": "Windows"
            },
            "hidden": true,
            "environment": {
                "NINJA_ROOT"  : "C:/app/dev/ninja",
                "VCPKG_ROOT"  : "C:/app/dev/vcpkg",
                "CMAKE_ROOT"  : "C:/app/dev/Qt/Tools/CMake_64",
                "QT_ROOT"     : "C:/app/dev/Qt/6.10.3/msvc2022_64",
                "VCINSTALLDIR": "C:/app/dev/msvs/2022/enterprise/VC",
                "SDK_ROOT"    : "C:/app/dev/WindowsKits/10",
                "VC_VERSION"  : "14.44.35207",
                "SDK_VERSION" : "10.0.26100.0",
                "BUILD_ARCH"  : "x64",
                "HTTP_PROXY"  : "http://127.0.0.1:2080",
                "HTTPS_PROXY" : "http://127.0.0.1:2080",
                "BUILD_TYPE"  : "Debug"
            }
        },
        {
            "name": "base-windows-debug-configure",
            "displayName": "debug configure",
            "description": "debug configure for windows",
            "condition":
            {
                "type": "equals",
                "lhs": "${hostSystemName}",
                "rhs": "Windows"
            },
            "inherits": ["base-configure", "base-windows-configure-define", "base-windows-configure-example"],
            "environment": {
                "BUILD_TYPE"  : "Debug"
            }
        },
        {
            "name": "base-windows-release-configure",
            "displayName": "release configure",
            "description": "release configure for windows",
            "condition":
            {
                "type": "equals",
                "lhs": "${hostSystemName}",
                "rhs": "Windows"
            },
            "inherits": ["base-configure", "base-windows-configure-define", "base-windows-configure-example"],
            "environment": {
                "BUILD_TYPE"  : "Release"
            }
        },
        {
            "name": "base-linux-configure",
            "displayName": "configure define",
            "description": "configure define for linux",
            "condition":
            {
                "type": "equals",
                "lhs": "${hostSystemName}",
                "rhs": "Linux"
            },
            "hidden": true,
            "environment": {
                "VCPKG_ROOT": "$penv{HOME}/workspace/tools/vcpkg",
                "PATH": "/home/linuxbrew/.linuxbrew/opt/binutils/bin:/home/linuxbrew/.linuxbrew/bin:$penv{PATH}",
                "CC": "/home/linuxbrew/.linuxbrew/bin/gcc-15",
                "CXX": "/home/linuxbrew/.linuxbrew/bin/g++-15",
                "PKG_CONFIG_PATH": "/home/linuxbrew/.linuxbrew/opt/sqlcipher/lib/pkgconfig:$penv{PKG_CONFIG_PATH}",
                "COMPILER_PATH": "/home/linuxbrew/.linuxbrew/opt/binutils/bin:$penv{COMPILER_PATH}",
                "LD_LIBRARY_PATH": "/home/linuxbrew/.linuxbrew/lib/gcc/current:/home/linuxbrew/.linuxbrew/lib:$penv{LD_LIBRARY_PATH}",
                "PROJECT_NAME": "TaoTieChatServer"
            },
            "cacheVariables": {
                "CMAKE_C_COMPILER": "/home/linuxbrew/.linuxbrew/bin/gcc-15",
                "CMAKE_CXX_COMPILER": "/home/linuxbrew/.linuxbrew/bin/g++-15",
                "PKG_CONFIG_EXECUTABLE": "/home/linuxbrew/.linuxbrew/bin/pkg-config",
                "VCPKG_INSTALL_OPTIONS": "--allow-unsupported",
                "CMAKE_MAKE_PROGRAM": "/home/linuxbrew/.linuxbrew/bin/ninja",
                "VCPKG_OVERLAY_PORTS": "${sourceDir}/vcpkg-overlays"
            }
        },
        {
            "name": "base-linux-debug-configure",
            "displayName": "debug configure",
            "description": "debug configure for linux",
            "condition":
            {
                "type": "equals",
                "lhs": "${hostSystemName}",
                "rhs": "Linux"
            },
            "inherits": ["base-configure", "base-linux-configure"]
        },
        {
            "name": "base-linux-release-configure",
            "displayName": "release configure",
            "description": "release configure for linux",
            "condition":
            {
                "type": "equals",
                "lhs": "${hostSystemName}",
                "rhs": "Linux"
            },
            "inherits": ["base-configure", "base-linux-configure"]
        }
    ],
    "buildPresets": [
        {
            "name": "base-windows-debug-build",
            "displayName": "debug build",
            "description": "debug build for windows",
            "condition":
            {
                "type": "equals",
                "lhs": "${hostSystemName}",
                "rhs": "Windows"
            },
            "configurePreset": "base-windows-debug-configure",
            "configuration": "Debug"
        },
        {
            "name": "base-windows-release-build",
            "displayName": "release build",
            "description": "release build for windows",
            "condition":
            {
                "type": "equals",
                "lhs": "${hostSystemName}",
                "rhs": "Windows"
            },
            "configurePreset": "base-windows-release-configure",
            "configuration": "Release"
        },
        {
            "name": "base-windows-debug-install",
            "displayName": "debug install",
            "description": "debug install for windows",
            "condition":
            {
                "type": "equals",
                "lhs": "${hostSystemName}",
                "rhs": "Windows"
            },
            "configurePreset": "base-windows-debug-configure",
            "configuration": "Debug",
            "targets": [
                "install"
            ]
        },
        {
            "name": "base-windows-release-install",
            "displayName": "release install",
            "description": "release install for windows",
            "condition":
            {
                "type": "equals",
                "lhs": "${hostSystemName}",
                "rhs": "Windows"
            },
            "configurePreset": "base-windows-release-configure",
            "configuration": "Release",
            "targets": [
                "install"
            ]
        },
        {
            "name": "base-linux-debug-build",
            "displayName": "debug build",
            "description": "debug build for linux",
            "condition":
            {
                "type": "equals",
                "lhs": "${hostSystemName}",
                "rhs": "Linux"
            },
            "configurePreset": "base-linux-debug-configure",
            "configuration": "Debug"
        },
        {
            "name": "base-linux-release-build",
            "displayName": "release build",
            "description": "release build for linux",
            "condition":
            {
                "type": "equals",
                "lhs": "${hostSystemName}",
                "rhs": "Linux"
            },
            "configurePreset": "base-linux-release-configure",
            "configuration": "Release"
        },
        {
            "name": "base-linux-debug-install",
            "displayName": "debug install",
            "description": "debug install for windows",
            "condition":
            {
                "type": "equals",
                "lhs": "${hostSystemName}",
                "rhs": "Linux"
            },
            "configurePreset": "base-linux-debug-configure",
            "configuration": "Debug",
            "targets": [
                "install"
            ]
        },
        {
            "name": "base-linux-release-install",
            "displayName": "release install",
            "description": "release install for windows",
            "condition":
            {
                "type": "equals",
                "lhs": "${hostSystemName}",
                "rhs": "Linux"
            },
            "configurePreset": "base-linux-release-configure",
            "configuration": "Release",
            "targets": [
                "install"
            ]
        }
    ],
    "testPresets": [
        {
            "name": "base-windows-debug-test",
            "displayName": "debug test ",
            "description": "debug test for windows",
            "condition":
            {
                "type": "equals",
                "lhs": "${hostSystemName}",
                "rhs": "Windows"
            },
            "configurePreset": "base-windows-debug-configure",
            "configuration": "Debug",
            "execution": {
                "stopOnFailure": false,
                "noTestsAction": "ignore"
            }
        },
        {
            "name": "base-windows-release-test",
            "displayName": "release test",
            "description": "release test for windows",
            "condition":
            {
                "type": "equals",
                "lhs": "${hostSystemName}",
                "rhs": "Windows"
            },
            "configurePreset": "base-windows-release-configure",
            "configuration": "Release",
            "execution": {
                "stopOnFailure": false,
                "noTestsAction": "ignore"
            }
        },
        {
            "name": "base-linux-debug-test",
            "displayName": "debug test ",
            "description": "debug test for linux",
            "condition":
            {
                "type": "equals",
                "lhs": "${hostSystemName}",
                "rhs": "Linux"
            },
            "configurePreset": "base-linux-debug-configure",
